sequenceDiagram
  %% Canvas interaction flow draft
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant T as Toolbar
  participant E as Editor Component
  participant H as useCanvasEditor Hook
  participant F as Fabric Canvas

  U->>T: Click Snap To Grid toggle
  T->>E: toggleSnapToGrid()
  E->>H: toggleSnapToGrid()
  H->>H: Update snapToGrid state/ref

  U->>F: Drag selected object
  F->>H: object:moving event(target)
  alt Snap enabled
    H->>F: Round left/top to nearest 20px grid
    H->>F: Apply snapped coordinates
  else Snap disabled
    H->>F: Keep free movement
  end

  U->>F: Release object
  F->>H: object:modified
  H->>H: saveHistory()

  U->>T: Undo / Redo
  T->>H: undo() / redo()
  H->>F: loadFromJSON(snapshot)
